OL,3,GNEWSA'Missed opportunities' to prevent
OL,4,Acare home resident's falls, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA care home "missed opportunities" to
OL,8,Fprevent a resident falling dozens of
OL,9,Ftimes in one year, a coroner has
OL,10,Fconcluded.
OL,12,FWinifred Tubb, 78, was living at St
OL,13,FLuke's care home in Runcorn in 2021
OL,14,Fwhen she fell 32 times in 11 months.
OL,15,FShe sustained a head injury in one
OL,16,Ffall, and a fractured hip bone in
OL,17,Fanother.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
