OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1795615016
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Missed opportunities' to prevent
OL,4,Acare home resident's falls, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FCoroner Jacqueline Devonish concluded
OL,8,Fshe had died from Covid-19 in December
OL,9,F2022 and that the falls did not cause
OL,10,For contribute to her death. The inquest
OL,11,Ffound vascular dementia and a lung
OL,12,Fcondition contributed to her frailty.
OL,14,FWinifred's daughter Kylie Gobin said:
OL,15,F"We're happy that the coroner looked
OL,16,Finto missed opportunities and there
OL,17,Fwill be lessons learnt. Hopefully it
OL,18,Fwill prevent further deaths."
